file .claude/rules/stamp-and-name.md a room folds by what its files are found by -- day or first sprig letter
file .cursor/rules/stamp-and-name.mdc the Cursor twin, same amendment
file construction/CHECKPOINTS.md walk-back nib 0d87a51fcd, recorded before the cut
file construction/REDS.md rows %166, %167, %168 booked; row %165 folded to archive under the 24,576-byte bound
file construction/standing-equipment.kyri tool_path_repoint seated as the 30th guard
file tools/fixtures/geode_libraries_scan.sh a recursive find rather than a flat glob, so the witness count is a number again
file tools/fixtures/witness_claim_check_scan.sh the same fix, with tools/fixtures pruned as instrument
file tools/fixtures/caravan_roster_bijection_scan.sh two levels, not one
file tools/ca/caravan_suite_witness.rish the same, and the choir sings 108 again
file tools/ca/caravan_ladder_copy_witness.rish its two planted pens built from a recursive find
file tools/co/corpus_twin_verbose.sh a tool_home helper that tries the two-letter room first
file pond/apps/corpora/one_clock.rish retargeted one level deeper
file tools/fixtures/tame_usize_audit.rye retargeted into the rye room
file construction/standing-equipment.kyri living_card_ascii seated as the 31st guard
file construction/ITINERARY.md Now refilled with the landed fold and its three reds
recommend keep-going -- the fold is landed, all 31 rostered guards GREEN, and two pre-existing reds are named and open (pool_isolation, pond_ring_lantern -- module drift in linengrow/ and pond/, both older than this fold). Standfast points the next lap at those two first. Next in Tier 1: the 848 seed-dead links, then a Door-setting front page for Caravan and for Mycelium, which is what the ranked remainder calls the real crux -- a reader arriving today still cannot say in one sentence what either module does. The seed force-push stays Keaton's word.
